section "mod-tome/data/chats/antimagic-end.lua"

t("\n\n#{italic}##LIGHT_GREEN#*As you drink the potion, your runes start to burn as they fade away, and a terrible agony seems to sink through your skin to your bones, muscles, and heart.  You black out from the pain, and come to a bit later, the runes gone forever.  You feel very ill, and yet...  cleansed.*#{normal}##WHITE#", "\n\n#{italic}##LIGHT_GREEN#*当你喝下药水，你的符文逐渐燃烧着消失，一股可怕的痛苦感从你的皮肤逐渐渗透到骨骼、肌肉、心脏。在痛苦中，你感到一阵晕眩袭来。醒来后，你发现身上的符文永远消失了。你感到无比疲惫……然而，你终于被自然的力量所净化了。*#{normal}##WHITE#", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "mod-tome/data/chats/ardhungol-start.lua"

t("I have got enough problems sorry.", "我已经够麻烦了，抱歉。", "_t")

