section "mod-tome/data/timed_effects/mental.lua"

t("Mind and body exposed to effects and attacks, reducing all saves and defense by %d.", "精神和身体暴露于攻击和效果中，闪避和豁免减少 %d。", "tformat")
t("The target is losing hope, all damage it does is reduced by %d%%.", "目标失去希望，造成的伤害减少 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("The target is silenced, preventing it from casting spells and using some vocal talents.", "目标被沉默，无法施放法术或使用部分发声类技能。", "_t")
t("The target has been marked as the focus for all nature summons within %d radius, receiving %d%% increased damage from nature summons.", "目标被半径 %d 内所有自然召唤物集火，从自然召唤物那里受到的伤害增加 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is no longer being targeted by summons.", "#Target#不再被召唤物锁定为目标。", "_t")
t("The target is confused, acting randomly (chance %d%%) and unable to perform complex actions.", "目标陷入混乱，有 %d%% 几率随机行动，并且无法执行复杂动作。", "tformat")
t("#Target# wanders around!", "#Target#漫无目的地四处游荡！", "_t")
t("The target's mind has been shattered. Its body remains as a thrall to %s.", "目标的心智已被摧毁，身体仍受 %s 奴役。", "tformat")
t("#Target#'s mind is shattered.", "#Target#的心智已被摧毁。", "_t")
t("Thrall", "奴仆", "_t")
t("#Target# lashes out with pure willpower.", "#Target#爆发纯粹意志发动攻击。", "_t")
t("#Target#'s willpower rush ends.", "#Target#的意志爆发结束了。", "_t")
t("The gloom reduces damage the target inflicts by %d%%.", "黑暗降低目标造成的伤害 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("The gloom reduces the target's global speed by %d%%.", "降低目标全局速度 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Prey damage modifier: %d%%.", "猎捕伤害加成： %d%%。", "tformat")
t(" Prey damage modifier: %d%%.", " 猎捕伤害加成： %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Beckoned", "受召", "_t")
t("The target has been beckoned by %s and is heeding the call. There is a %d%% chance of moving towards the beckoner each turn.", "目标受到 %s 的召唤并响应其呼唤，每回合有 %d%% 概率向召唤者移动。", "tformat")
t("#Target# has been beckoned.", "#Target#受到召唤。", "_t")
t("+Beckoned", "+受召", "_t")
t("#Target# is no longer beckoned.", "#Target#不再受召唤。", "_t")
t("-Beckoned", "-受召", "_t")
t("#F53CBE#%s struggles against the beckoning.", "#F53CBE#%s挣扎着抵抗召唤。", "logSeen")
t("#F53CBE#%s is jolted to attention by the damage and is no longer being beckoned.", "#F53CBE#%s受到伤害后猛然清醒，不再受召唤。", "logSeen")
t("The cursed miasma around #target# dissipates.", "#target#周围的诅咒瘴气消失了。", "_t")
t("The target has been harassed by its stalker, reducing damage by %d%%.", "目标被追踪至疲倦，伤害减低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("The target has been dominated.  It is unable to move and has lost %d armor and %d defense. Attacks from %s gain %d%% damage penetration.", "目标已被支配，无法移动，并失去 %d 点护甲和 %d 点闪避。来自 %s 的攻击获得 %d%% 抗性穿透。", "tformat")
t("Madness reduces the target's global speed by %d%% and lowers mind resistance by %d%%.", "疯狂使目标的全局速度降低 %d%%，精神抗性降低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Madness has stunned the target, reducing damage by 50%%, lowering mind resistance by %d%%, putting 4 random talents on cooldown and reducing movement speed by 50%%.  While stunned talents cooldown twice as slow.", "目标因疯狂而被震慑，造成的伤害降低 50%%，精神抗性降低 %d%%，4 个随机技能进入冷却，移动速度降低 50%%。震慑期间，技能冷却速度减半。", "tformat")
t("power", "强度", "effect subtype")
t("Maligned", "恶意缠身", "_t")
t("The target is under a malign influence. All resists have been lowered by %d%%.", "目标受到恶意影响，所有伤害抗性降低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#F53CBE##Target# has been maligned!", "#F53CBE##Target#受到恶意影响！", "_t")
t("+Maligned", "+恶意缠身", "_t")
t("#Target# is no longer maligned", "#Target#不再受恶意影响。", "_t")
t("-Maligned", "-恶意缠身", "_t")
t("The target is in despair, reducing their armour, defence, mindsave and mind resist by %d.", "目标陷入绝望，护甲，闪避，精神豁免和精神抗性降低 %d。", "tformat")
t("The target is terrified taking %d mind and darkness damage per turn and increasing all their cooldowns by %d%%.", "目标陷入惊恐，每回合受到 %d 点精神和暗影伤害，所有冷却时间增加 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("The target is haunted by a feeling of dread, causing each detrimental mental effect to inflict %d mind and darkness damage every turn.", "目标被恐惧感纠缠，每个精神负面效果都会使其每回合受到 %d 点精神和暗影伤害。", "tformat")
t("#F53CBE##Source# panics but fails to flee from #Target#.", "#F53CBE##Source#因恐惧而试图逃离#Target#，但是失败了。", "logCombat")
t("This creatures psionic focus item is supercharged!", "这个生物的灵能聚焦物品被超载充能了！", "_t")
t("Spiked Kinetic Shield", "尖刺念力护盾", "_t")
t("A powerful kinetic shield forms around #target#.", "#target#四周形成了强大的念力护盾。", "_t")
t("The powerful kinetic shield around #target# crumbles.", "#target#的念力护盾消失了。", "_t")
t("Spiked Thermal Shield", "尖刺热能护盾", "_t")
t("The target erects a powerful thermal shield capable of absorbing %d/%d fire%s or cold damage before it crumbles.", "目标施放一个热能护盾，在碎裂前吸收 %d/%d 火焰%s或寒冷伤害。", "tformat")
t("A powerful thermal shield forms around #target#.", "#target#获得了热能护盾。", "_t")
t("The powerful thermal shield around #target# crumbles.", "#target#的热能护盾消失了。", "_t")
t("Spiked Charged Shield", "尖刺充能护盾", "_t")
t("The target erects a powerful charged shield capable of absorbing %d/%d lightning%s or blight damage before it crumbles.", "目标施放一个充能护盾吸收 %d/%d 闪电 %s 或枯萎伤害。", "tformat")
t("A powerful charged shield forms around #target#.", "#target#获得了充能护盾。", "_t")
t("The powerful charged shield around #target# crumbles.", "#target#的充能护盾消失了。", "_t")
t("The target is seeing echoes from the void and will take %0.2f mind damage as well as some resource damage each turn it fails a mental save.", "目标受到虚空的回响，每回合若精神豁免失败，将受到 %0.2f 精神伤害以及部分资源伤害。", "tformat")
t("The target is plagued by inner demons and each turn there's a %d%% chance that one will appear.  If the caster is killed or the target resists setting his demons loose the effect will end early.", "目标被内心恶魔困扰，每回合有 %d%% 的几率出现一个恶魔。如果施法者被杀死，或目标抵抗而不释放自己的心魔，效果将提前结束。", "tformat")
t("The target's accuracy is improved by %d.", "目标的命中提高 %d。", "tformat")
t("The target's armour penetration is increased by %d.", "目标护甲穿透提高 %d。", "tformat")
t([[Increases global action speed by %d%% and physical crit by %d%%.
Additionally the target will continue to fight until its Life reaches -%d%%.]], [[全局速度提升 %d%% 并提高物理暴击率 %d%%。
此外，目标会继续战斗，直到生命值降至 -%d%%。]], "tformat")
t("%s dies when its frenzy ends!", "%s在狂热结束时死亡！", "logSeen")
t("The target's strength is increased by %d by the thrill of combat.", "由于紧张的战斗，目标力量属性增加 %d。", "tformat")
t("The target's maximum life is increased by %d.", "目标生命上限增加 %d。", "tformat")
t(" with a %d%% chance to counterattack", "，并有 %d%% 几率发动反击", "tformat")
t("Orcish Fury", "兽人狂暴", "_t")
t("Inspired by a recent kill increasing all resistance by %d%%.", "受最近一次击杀的鼓舞，所有抗性提高 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("#Target# roars triumphantly.", "#Target#得意地咆哮。", "_t")
t("Reduces the time taken for summoning by %d%%.", "降低召唤耗时 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("%d%% chance to get a more powerful summon.", "%d%% 几率召唤出更强大的召唤物。", "tformat")
t("Lobotomized (confused)", "脑叶切除（混乱）", "_t")
t("The target's mental faculties have been severely impaired, making it act randomly each turn (%d%% chance) and reducing its cunning by %d.", "目标的精神判断力严重受损，每回合 (%d%% 概率) 随机动作并降低灵巧 %d。", "tformat")
t("Reduces all incoming %s damage by %d.", "减少受到的 %s 伤害 %d。", "tformat")
t("A psychic field forms around #target#.", "#target#周围产生一圈灵能领域。", "_t")
t("The psychic field around #target# crumbles.", "#target#周围的灵能领域破碎了。", "_t")
t("The target's mind has been invaded, increasing all mind damage it receives from %s by %d%%.", "目标遭到精神入侵，提升它受到 %s 的精神伤害 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Feedback Loop", "反馈循环", "_t")
t("#Target# is gaining feedback.", "#Target#正在获取反馈值。", "_t")
t("+Feedback Loop", "+反馈循环", "_t")
t("-Feedback Loop", "-反馈循环", "_t")
t("Slumber", "沉睡", "_t")
t("+Slumber", "+沉睡", "_t")
t("-Slumber", "-沉睡", "_t")
t("The target is in a nightmarish sleep, suffering %0.2f darkness damage each turn and unable to to perform most actions.  Every %d damage it takes will reduce the duration of the effect by one turn.", "目标陷入噩梦般的沉睡，每回合受到 %0.2f 暗影伤害，并且无法执行大多数行动。每受到 %d 点伤害，效果持续时间便减少 1 回合。", "tformat")
t("The target's mental faculties have been impaired, reducing its mental save by %d.", "目标的精神能力被削弱，精神豁免降低 %d。", "tformat")
t("The target's dreams have been broken by the dreamforge, reducing its mental save by %d and reducing its chance of successfully casting a spell by %d%%.", "目标被梦境熔炉打破梦境，精神豁免降低 %d，施法成功率降低 %d%%。", "tformat")
t("Absorbs %d damage from the next blockable attack.  Currently Blocking: %s.", "吸收下一次可格挡攻击造成的 %d 点伤害。当前格挡：%s。", "tformat")
t("#Target# is surrounded by antimagic forces.", "#Target#被反魔法力量环绕。", "_t")
t("The target is infected with a mind parasite. Each time it uses a talent it has a %d%% chance to have %d random talent(s) put on cooldown for %d turns.", "目标被精神寄生虫感染，每次使用技能时有 %d%% 几率让 %d 个随机技能进入 %d 回合的冷却。", "tformat")
t("Repeated mindlash usage is very taxing increasing the psi cost each time (currently %d%%)", "重复使用心灵鞭笞十分消耗能量，每次都会增加灵能值消耗（当前 %d%%）", "tformat")
t("A random shadow absorbed a fatal blow for you, granting you a negative shield of %d.", "一个随机的阴影为你吸收了一次致命伤害，为你提供一个 %d 强度的负能量护盾。", "tformat")
t("The power released by the %s resonates.", "%s释放的力量产生了共鸣。", "tformat")
t("#Target# glints with a crystaline aura", "#Target#周身闪烁着水晶光环", "_t")
t("A psionic shield forms around #target#.", "#target#周围形成一层灵能护盾。", "_t")
t("The psionic shield around #target# crumbles.", "#target#周围的灵能护盾破碎了。", "_t")

