t("#PURPLE#The Ring writhes and contracts around your finger and suddently you realize your now possess the prodigy #LIGHT_GREEN#%s%s!", "#PURPLE#戒指在你指间扭动收缩，突然间，你掌握了觉醒技#LIGHT_GREEN#%s%s！", "log")
