t("Originally a kitchen implement used by the giants to saw through tough, frozen carcasses. Something is especially sinister about this example though.", "起初这个锯子只是被巨人们用来切割坚硬、冰冻的尸体。不过这个例子似乎有一些非常邪恶的暗示。", "_t")
